# S50 (May 2026): Stack Overflow 2025 Developer Survey raw files.
# Only data/so_survey_2025_aggregates.json (130 KB) is committed.
# Raw CSV is 141 MB and can be regenerated by running:
#   curl -sL -o data/so_survey_2025.zip https://survey.stackoverflow.co/datasets/stack-overflow-developer-survey-2025.zip
#   unzip -o data/so_survey_2025.zip -d data/so_survey_2025/
#   python3 scripts/aggregate_so_survey_2025.py
